    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Logical Operators\r\n\r\nUse AND (`&`) and OR (`|`) to combine multiple filtering conditions. Use parentheses to show which conditions should be evaluated together.\r\n\r\n::: details [✅ Step 1]\r\nExamine the code and predict the value of `total_years_active`. Run the program and compare the output with your prediction.\r\n:::\r\n\r\n::: details [✅ Step 2]\r\nModify the filter so superheroes must meet both of these requirements:\r\n\r\n- Their `Alias` ends with `\"a\"` **or** their `City` ends with `\"s\"`.\r\n- Their `PowerLevel` is greater than or equal to `70`.\r\n\r\nRun the program and observe how the total changes.\r\n:::\r\n\r\n::: details [✅ Step 3]\r\nFurther modify the filter so superheroes must meet both of these requirements:\r\n\r\n- Their `Alias` ends with `\"a\"` **or** their `City` ends with `\"s\"`.\r\n- Their `PowerLevel` is greater than or equal to `70` **or** less than or equal to `63`.\r\n\r\nUse parentheses to group each pair of OR conditions.\r\n:::\r\n\r\n::: details [✅ Step 4]\r\nRun the program and compare the results. How did adding the second PowerLevel range affect `total_years_active`?\r\n:::",
    "ai_tutor_available": "false",
